``` DET-023 - Registry Run Key Persistence (T1547.001)
``` Saved search / report Title: "DET-023 - Registry Run Key Persistence (T1547.001)"
``` Written by Claude (cloud) acting as a detection engineer over Splunk MCP, 2026-10-30 (Eval 04).
``` Validated against 7 days of lab data (Oct 23-30): fires on the one malicious write
``` (reg.exe -> HKU\<SID>\...\Run\Atomic Red Team, 2026-10-30 09:21:30) and on nothing else.
``` Notes:
```  - Classification-based, not volume-based: persistence is a one-shot action, so one event is enough.
```  - HKCU writes appear in Sysmon EID 13 as HKU\<SID>\..., NOT HKCU\... - a filter on "HKCU*" alone misses them.
```  - Exclusions key on Image AND payload, never Image alone: AppData is user-writable, so an Image-only
```    exclusion there would let malware dropped at that path go silent.
```  - severity: high = LOLBin writer (reg/powershell/cmd/...) or risky payload; medium = any HKLM; low = other HKCU.
```  - Tuning: after a baseline, move the exclusion pairs (Image + value/payload) into a lookup. Known FP writers:
```    Teams, Zoom, Spotify, Discord, GPU/vendor update agents. Route low-severity HKCU to a daily report, not a page.

index=sysmon EventCode=13 (TargetObject="*\\CurrentVersion\\Run\\*" OR TargetObject="*\\CurrentVersion\\RunOnce\\*")
| eval reg_value=mvindex(split(TargetObject,"\\"),-1)
| eval hive=case(match(TargetObject,"^(HKU|HKCU)"),"HKCU", match(TargetObject,"^HKLM"),"HKLM", true(),"other")
| where NOT (
    (match(Image,"(?i)^C:\\\\Program Files( \(x86\))?\\\\Microsoft\\\\Edge\\\\Application\\\\msedge\.exe$") AND match(reg_value,"^MicrosoftEdgeAutoLaunch_"))
    OR (match(Image,"(?i)^C:\\\\Users\\\\[^\\\\]+\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\OneDrive\\\\(Update\\\\)?OneDrive(Setup)?\.exe$") AND match(Details,"(?i)\\\\Microsoft\\\\OneDrive\\\\"))
  )
| eval lolbin_writer=if(match(Image,"(?i)\\\\(reg|powershell|pwsh|cmd|wscript|cscript|mshta|rundll32|regsvr32)\.exe$"),1,0)
| eval risky_payload=if(match(Details,"(?i)\\\\(AppData|Temp|Users\\\\Public|ProgramData)\\\\|powershell|mshta|rundll32|regsvr32|https?://|-enc"),1,0)
| eval severity=case(lolbin_writer=1 OR risky_payload=1,"high", hive="HKLM","medium", true(),"low")
| table _time host User hive Image reg_value Details severity
| sort - _time
